      "relations": "A unit shift toward greater patience is associated with 0.362 kg/m² lower BMI in 1992 (p=2.2e-04). BMI requires height, but the height column used is unspecified."
    },
    {
      "text": "The negative association between the 1989 household-savings-action proxy and 1989 BMI is stronger in the designated unmarried subsample.",
      "context": "NLSY79 subsample designated unmarried using 1989 residence codes {17,18,19} (n=487), described as avoiding dilution of household savings by a spouse.",
      "variables": [
        "Was more money put into or taken out of R/spouse savings since last interview, 1989",
        "Weight of respondent, 1989",
        "Type of residence respondent is living in, 1989"
